## Quick Start

Here's a quick start to using the CoinGecko API:

```typescript
// Get the top 7 trending cryptocurrencies.
async function getTrendingCoins() {
  const trending = await client.search();
  console.log(trending.coins);
  return trending.coins;
}
```

```typescript
// Extract the names and market cap rank of the trending coins.
async function getTrendingCoinNamesAndRanks() {
  const trending = await client.search();
  const coinInfo = trending.coins.map(coin => ({
    name: coin.item.name,
    marketCapRank: coin.item.market_cap_rank
  }));
  console.log(coinInfo);
  return coinInfo;
}
```

